From 6b7bc09e9df399cfb64e2ddde120c55ce33fd9bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: S20FE Charging Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 00:36:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] battery: add opt-in maximum wired charging SIOP policy

Preserve raw Samsung SIOP for telemetry while allowing wired charging
to consume an effective SIOP of 100 when charge_max_mode is enabled.

Cover ICL/FCC, VBUS/PDO, charging timer and wired/direct step-charging
decisions. Keep independent thermal, LRP, AICL, swelling, OVP/health
and taper protections intact. Expose a stable battery sysfs switch and
default it off.

Signed-off-by: S20FE Charging Project <noreply@example.invalid>
---
 drivers/battery_v2/include/sec_battery.h      |  5 ++
 .../battery_v2/include/sec_battery_sysfs.h    |  1 +
 drivers/battery_v2/sec_battery.c              | 66 ++++++++++++++-----
 drivers/battery_v2/sec_battery_sysfs.c        | 25 +++++++
 drivers/battery_v2/sec_step_charging.c        | 17 +++--
 5 files changed, 90 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

